language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Rearrange the numbers 1 to 12 on the face of a clock so that no triplet of adjacent numbers has a sum higher than 21.
find x : matrix indexed by [int(1..12)] of int(1..12)

branching on [x]

such that
$ the twelve positions of the clock hold the twelve different numbers 1 to 12
allDiff(x),
$ every triplet of adjacent numbers on the clock has a sum of at most 21; the clock wraps around from position 12 back to position 1
forAll i : int(1..12) . (x[i] + x[i % 12 + 1] + x[(i + 1) % 12 + 1]) <= 21
